He gave:
$$
9 \text{ stickers} \text{ to his sister}
$$

He used:
$$
28 \text{ stickers} \text{ to decorate a greeting card}
$$

Total stickers used or given away:
$$
9 + 28 = 37
$$

Now, subtract that from the total:
$$
54 - 37 = 17
$$

---

### Final Answer:

$$
\boxed{17}
$$

